{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey Caroline, since we last chatted, I've had a lot of things happening to me. I ran a charity race for mental health last Saturday \u2013 it was really rewarding. Really made me think about taking care of our minds."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-988ec27f0f973453b1eedd48", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:36.288963+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "988ec27f0f973453b1eedd48", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "988ec27f0f973453b1eedd48", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That charity race sounds great, Mel! Making a difference & raising awareness for mental health is super rewarding - I'm really proud of you for taking part!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-0f2038960bdb50759de578e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:40.383150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0f2038960bdb50759de578e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0f2038960bdb50759de578e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! The event was really thought-provoking. I'm starting to realize that self-care is really important. It's a journey for me, but when I look after myself, I'm able to better look after my family."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-c88bc54d1a19d9c486477c1e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:44.515138+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c88bc54d1a19d9c486477c1e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c88bc54d1a19d9c486477c1e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I totally agree, Melanie. Taking care of ourselves is so important - even if it's not always easy. Great that you're prioritizing self-care."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-db057c34596efdf39951194b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:48.673823+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "db057c34596efdf39951194b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "db057c34596efdf39951194b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, it's tough. So I'm carving out some me-time each day - running, reading, or playing my violin - which refreshes me and helps me stay present for my fam!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-d2956f0ea0a878045d68d70e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:52.785544+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d2956f0ea0a878045d68d70e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d2956f0ea0a878045d68d70e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That's great, Mel! Taking time for yourself is so important. You're doing an awesome job looking after yourself and your family!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-ec8bbaa50357d7a0dcc1bf4d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:15:56.888378+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec8bbaa50357d7a0dcc1bf4d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec8bbaa50357d7a0dcc1bf4d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline. It's still a work in progress, but I'm doing my best. My kids are so excited about summer break! We're thinking about going camping next month. Any fun plans for the summer?"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-ba43ea296d3df17de238a1da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:01.011117+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ba43ea296d3df17de238a1da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ba43ea296d3df17de238a1da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Researching adoption agencies \u2014 it's been a dream to have a family and give a loving home to kids who need it."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-2515365bd217f4f9c914e8d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:05.108910+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2515365bd217f4f9c914e8d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2515365bd217f4f9c914e8d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's awesome! Taking in kids in need - you're so kind. Your future family is gonna be so lucky to have you!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-2da697c383b080c35edbb3f0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:09.245038+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2da697c383b080c35edbb3f0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2da697c383b080c35edbb3f0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! My goal is to give kids a loving home. I'm truly grateful for all the support I've got from friends and mentors. Now the hard work starts to turn my dream into a reality. And here's one of the adoption agencies I'm looking into. It's a lot to take in, but I'm feeling hopeful and optimistic."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-744ff1f5e20a9fdec1bce21f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:13.368682+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "744ff1f5e20a9fdec1bce21f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "744ff1f5e20a9fdec1bce21f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, that agency looks great! What made you pick it?"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-48bc08dacddf6bcc27c6a4ff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:17.490204+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "48bc08dacddf6bcc27c6a4ff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "48bc08dacddf6bcc27c6a4ff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I chose them 'cause they help LGBTQ+ folks with adoption. Their inclusivity and support really spoke to me."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-66f9729bfc0339d869d67e73", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:21.615107+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66f9729bfc0339d869d67e73", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66f9729bfc0339d869d67e73", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That's great, Caroline! Loving the inclusivity and support. Anything you're excited for in the adoption process?"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-14c49ca386ba2e7f8a62fe5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:25.751088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "14c49ca386ba2e7f8a62fe5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "14c49ca386ba2e7f8a62fe5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I'm thrilled to make a family for kids who need one. It'll be tough as a single parent, but I'm up for the challenge!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-cafb3da1a0ab44e8ddbdec74", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:29.891965+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cafb3da1a0ab44e8ddbdec74", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cafb3da1a0ab44e8ddbdec74", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: You're doing something amazing! Creating a family for those kids is so lovely. You'll be an awesome mom! Good luck!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-d15992169a3f7d2341113adf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:34.032087+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d15992169a3f7d2341113adf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d15992169a3f7d2341113adf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! Your kind words really mean a lot. I'll do my best to make sure these kids have a safe and loving home."}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-4912471ee2abd663444bb011", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:38.172867+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4912471ee2abd663444bb011", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4912471ee2abd663444bb011", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: No doubts, Caroline. You have such a caring heart - they'll get all the love and stability they need! Excited for this new chapter!"}, "creation_event": "h4wire-c-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_2-0803c196f47685a7260139cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:42.287623+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0803c196f47685a7260139cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0803c196f47685a7260139cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
